    turn this way. When your opponent activates a card or effect (Quick Effect):
    You can return this card from the field to the hand; Special Summon 1 LIGHT Ritual
    Monster (Warrior or Dragon) from your hand or Deck, but shuffle it into the Deck
    during the End Phase of the next turn. You can only use this effect of "Sauravis,
    Dragon Sage of the Voiceless Voice" once per turn.'
